  "label": "Anti-Black Racism",
  "description": "A system of racial discrimination and prejudice against Black people, often rooted in historical oppression such as slavery and systemic inequality. The meme perpetuates anti-Black racism by using the historical suffering of Black people to mock or trivialize the Black Friday shopping event, thereby reducing trauma to a commercial promotion and inflicting pain on a marginalized group through racialized commerce.",
